== Effects ==
* While firing, creates an aura around Isaac that [[Status Effects#Poison|poisons]] any nearby enemies for 2 ticks.
** The poison may stack up to 6 ticks at a time.
** The aura range is approximately two tiles.
* Poison damage is equal to Isaac's [[damage]] stat.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r}} This item can be spawned by {{e|Bumbino}} if he picks up 12 cents.{{dlc-}}

== Interactions ==
* {{C|Azazel}}/{{i|Brimstone}}/{{i|Chocolate Milk}}/{{i|Mom's Knife}}/{{i|Monstro's Lung}}/{{i|Tech X}}: The green aura only activates when Isaac's attack is charging.
* {{i|Diplopia}}: No effect.
* {{i|Epic Fetus}}/{{i|The Ludovico Technique}}/{{i|Marked}}: The green aura only activates when pressing the attack buttons.
* {{C|The Forgotten}}: The green aura will activate when using melee and charging throw attack.
* {{C|Lilith}}: No effect.
* {{i|Mega Blast}}: The green aura will not activate while the beam is firing.
* {{i|Sprinkler}}: Green aura will not activate if only the sprinkler is firing, and the sprinkler does not get its own green aura.

